Help me reply to this email: {{email}}

What I want to say: {{my_points}}

Write a reply in the ClimbUK voice, UK English. Answer every question the sender asked, in their order, answer first. Keep it short: three short paragraphs at most. End with one clear next step. Do not promise anything I have not said (numbers of meetings, introductions, discounts, reports). Mark any fact you are unsure of with [CHECK]. Do not send it; show it to me first.

