Help me understand this agreement: {{document}}

Explain in plain words: who the parties are, what each side gives and gets, the money and when it is paid, key dates and notice periods, cancellation and refund terms, use of logos and names, data and privacy terms, and anything unusual or one-sided. Quote the clause for each point. Finish with questions to ask before signing.

This is a summary to help me read it, not legal advice.
